+    is ``{}`` for an override and the selected rule's defaults for a mapping resolution — so a
+    dimension the OLD rule alone supplied (here ``department``) is absent when the owner override
+    wins. This is the existing T-REF-15 precedence (step 1 before step 3), stated, not a new
+    arithmetic defect; unselected-rule defaults are not copied to keep the dimensions equal. The
+    component subject, the netting and the line's ``obligation_key``-free dimensions are unchanged
+    in both variants."""
+    base = _mapping()
+    with_default = AccountMappingInput(
